{"slug":"y-q-n","ar":"ي ق ن","total":28,"core":"certainty","forms":[{"ar":"يُوقِنُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":12,"gloss":"to be certain","word":null,"ex":{"s":45,"a":20,"p":7,"ar":["هَـٰذَا","بَصَـٰٓئِرُ","لِلنَّاسِ","وَهُدًى","وَرَحْمَةٌ","لِّقَوْمٍ","يُوقِنُونَ"],"en":"This [Qur'an] is enlightenment for mankind and guidance and mercy for a people who are certain [in faith]"}},{"ar":"يَقِين","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":8,"gloss":"Certainty, conviction","word":"91","ex":{"s":69,"a":51,"p":3,"ar":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَحَقُّ","ٱلْيَقِينِ"],"en":"And indeed, it is the truth of certainty"}},{"ar":"مُّوقِنِين","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"certain, convinced","word":null,"ex":{"s":51,"a":20,"p":4,"ar":["وَفِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ءَايَـٰتٌ","لِّلْمُوقِنِينَ"],"en":"And on the earth are signs for the certain [in faith]"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَيْقَنَتْ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":2,"gloss":"to be convinced","word":null,"ex":{"s":27,"a":14,"p":3,"ar":["وَجَحَدُوا۟","بِهَا","وَٱسْتَيْقَنَتْهَآ","أَنفُسُهُمْ","ظُلْمًا","وَعُلُوًّا ۚ","فَٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَـٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"en":"And they rejected them, while their [inner] selves were convinced thereof, out of injustice and haughtiness. So see how was the end of the corrupters"}},{"ar":"مُسْتَيْقِنِين","kind":"active participle","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"convinced, certain","word":null,"ex":{"s":45,"a":32,"p":22,"ar":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","إِنَّ","وَعْدَ","ٱللَّهِ","حَقٌّ","وَٱلسَّاعَةُ","لَا","رَيْبَ","فِيهَا","قُلْتُم","مَّا","نَدْرِى","مَا","ٱلسَّاعَةُ","إِن","نَّظُنُّ","إِلَّا","ظَنًّا","وَمَا","نَحْنُ","بِمُسْتَيْقِنِينَ"],"en":"And when it was said, 'Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth and the Hour [is coming] - no doubt about it,' you said, 'We know not what is the Hour. We assume only assumption, and we are not convinced"}}],"surahs":[[27,4],[45,3],[2,2],[32,2],[74,2],[102,2],[4,1],[5,1],[6,1],[13,1],[15,1],[26,1],[30,1],[31,1],[44,1],[51,1],[52,1],[56,1],[69,1]]}